    "component_id": "C044.signal_basis",
    "value": "Monitoring the same turnaround measurements through a predefined trial period shows an isolated improvement rather than improvement sustained across repeated periods.",
    "scope": "Post-selection trial monitoring. Apparent improvement can reflect measurement or operational variation; continued observation does not authorize continuing an unsafe or unacceptably disruptive trial.",
